{"repositoryId":1097623289,"availability":"available","full":"JittoJoseph/TinyFloor","name":"TinyFloor","description":"A small virtual office for remote teams: walk up to a teammate to talk, with proximity video chat. Free for up to 3 people, then $29/month for the whole team at tinyfloor.com. Open source (AGPL).","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":5,"created":"2025-11-16T14:34:31Z","updated":"2026-10-15T11:10:43Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://www.tinyfloor.com","topics":["cloudflare-workers","durable-objects","gather-alternative","nextjs","proximity-chat","proximity-video-chat","remote-team","remote-work","remote-working","team-collaboration","virtual-coworking","virtual-office","virtual-office-software","virtual-office-space","webrtc"],"demo":"https://www.tinyfloor.com/lobby","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:35.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:35.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:20:35.783Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:20:35.783Z","stars":14,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The virtual office your team can walk around in.","Walk up to someone to talk. Pull up a chair to meet. Free for up to 3 people.","Website · Try the demo office · Make an office · Pricing · Questions"],"features":["Walk up to a teammate and one tap starts a call. Channels, direct messages and reactions that stay. See who's in, busy or in a call, then walk right over.","A meeting room for group video calls with screen sharing: walk in to join, walk out to leave. Meetings get a full page too, with whoever's talking up front.","Your own desk. Sit down and make it yours; from then on you arrive at it, and teammates walking past see whose it is.","Invites that get sent: copy the link, copy a ready message for your team's chat, email it, or share it from your phone. Teammates pick a name and a character and join with a free account.",